# Part B analysis outputs. These are the direct inputs to
# scripts/generate_stats_macros.py (and the source of every \statPB macro in
# stats_macros.tex), so without them the generator cannot run on a fresh
# clone and Appendix B's "committed analysis script that reproduces every
# Part B table and figure directly from that data" is unsatisfiable. ~10KB.
